(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-43","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["七日后，顾峦用[[chalk|粉笔]]写回单日期。外商孩子等他说[[chess|国际象棋]]，沈砚觉得自己昔日想单独保田很[[childish|孩子气]]。货车的[[clatter|哗啦声]]抵村时，最后四户的[[clearing|款项结算]]终于有原手印。罗清去探那位死者家属，见新[[coffin|棺木]]已安置，不催他们去听钟。山风虽[[cold|冷]]，她仍站在院外等回应。守关[[colonel|长官]]退回扣货票，已移居内地的[[colonist|旧殖地居民]]也收到补款，原籍不影响领款。季禾只在证实回款的项目旁标[[completion|完成]]，尚需照护的费用继续单列。","村里年轻的[[composer|作曲者]]请顾峦帮改[[composition|曲子]]，唱词没有只写谁功劳大。顾衡叫工人[[comrade|伙伴]]，大家约一场小[[concert|合唱会]]，不用把沈砚唱成[[conqueror|征服者]]。水位须[[consistently|始终如一地]]记，伤者病历也保完整[[context|来龙去脉]]。季禾检查铜件[[corrosion|腐蚀]]，顾峦回自己的[[cottage|小屋]]，同一[[couple|对夫妇]]送来谢礼，他不替哥哥收作水闸的人情。罗清请他们把本可留给孩子的粮带回，说水是共有份额，不欠守闸人额外贡礼。两人回屋时笑了，担心的并不是礼轻，而是拒礼之后会不会再失水。","沈砚的[[courage|勇气]]不在每次自告奋勇。顾衡让更[[courageous|有勇气的]]青年也先练停闸，牧羊人牵[[cow|母牛]]来核她能饮的量，孩子拿[[crab|螃蟹]]想放井，被顾峦拦住。季禾觉得这不是[[crazy|疯狂的]]新生活，只是能慢慢做对。许庭的经营[[credential|凭据]]更新，附上误收费的[[deceit|欺骗]]记录，不能用[[deceptive|骗人的]]红漆当清洗证明。山边[[deer|鹿]]踏过新桥，板纹仍有小小的[[delicacy|精细处]]要护。渡仓妇人有了修船回款，她来信说不再将救生艇借作任何税押，原号刻得更深。","最后一份工图的[[description|说明]]没有许诺永不漏。沈砚不会[[desert|丢下]]药田，也不[[desperately|拼命地]]求回昔日剑法。顾峦校准钟的[[dial|钟面]]，季禾将[[diamond|菱形]]刻号留在接头上认班次。韩长老不再是水上的[[dictator|独裁者]]，只能按轮班图[[direct|指导]]被分给他的修缮。他的失去与年纪构成[[disadvantage|不利]]，旧责的[[disgrace|不名誉]]仍在，却无需继续羞辱才能监督。罗清让医馆[[dispense|分发]]最后一车订好的干布，救急物资账结，持续照护账按月公开，不把两项都提前划完。","每村各留一套[[documentary|文件的]]证据。上游旧约里有[[duke|公爵]]的赐印，也不能[[easily|轻易地]]掩过后附共同用水条。[[eastern|东侧的]]支路由当地人守，沈砚帮他们[[edit|修订]]文字，使新约的[[effect|效果]]落实在水到哪家。有些外乡人不再需要[[emigrate|迁走]]，也有人仍选择回故里。许庭还是能讨价的[[enemy|对手]]，如今亦是受检查的买卖人；合作并不消灭分歧。顾衡将剩余[[energy|精力]]用来教工人读尺，不求每个班头都与自己能力[[equal|相等]]，只求每个人知道自己在哪一步应停下叫人。","孤城的最后一封回信说，重症伤友已能坐在院里，腿还不能长路走；医费由专款继续付，旧工资已到家。陶溯的售水欺骗与挪款由税署分别核责，财货归还凭单明确，受罚不等于欠款自行消失。罗清读完将信收进医册，选择此后每季赴城会看一次，不把全部重担交给留下的人。沈砚把个人最后一笔医馆债交清，仍愿给新来的学徒付合理工钱。钟楼下，长期水约各本同文，各村都持一份。明年审看日期已写明；到那一天要看真实水量与人，而不是让今日的好故事替未来作主。"],"en":["Seven days later Luan wrote receipt dates in [[chalk|chalk]] as a child waited for [[chess|chess]]. Shen saw his former solitary field ambition as [[childish|childish]]. Wagon [[clatter|clatter]] brought the final four households’ [[clearing|clearing]] receipts. Luo visited a family beside its new [[coffin|coffin]], waiting outside in [[cold|cold]] wind. A gate [[colonel|colonel]] returned seizure tickets. An inland [[colonist|colonist]] received funds without origin restrictions. Ji marked [[completion|completion]] only beside actual payments, retaining continuing care separately.","A young [[composer|composer]] asked Luan to revise a [[composition|composition]] without sole-hero lyrics. Gu called workers [[comrade|comrades]]. Their small [[concert|concert]] celebrated no [[conqueror|conqueror]]. Measurements continued [[consistently|consistently]], with injury [[context|context]] preserved. Ji checked [[corrosion|corrosion]]. A [[couple|couple]] visited Luan’s [[cottage|cottage]] with gifts; he would not accept gate favours for Gu. Luo sent their grain home. Public shares required no tribute. Their relief came from learning refused gifts would not cost water.","Shen’s [[courage|courage]] no longer meant volunteering for everything. Even a [[courageous|courageous]] worker learnt stopping first. A shepherd checked a [[cow|cow]]’s water. Luan stopped a child releasing a [[crab|crab]] in the well. This was no [[crazy|crazy]] new life, just steady correction. Xu’s [[credential|credential]] retained the record of fee [[deceit|deceit]]; [[deceptive|deceptive]] paint could not certify cleaning. A [[deer|deer]] crossed their bridge with structural [[delicacy|delicacy]] still to protect. The storekeeper’s repair funds arrived, and her boat would never again be a tax pledge.","The final [[description|description]] promised no leak-free eternity. Shen would not [[desert|desert]] his field or [[desperately|desperately]] seek his old sword skill. Luan set the [[dial|dial]], and Ji marked parts with a [[diamond|diamond]]. Han was no water [[dictator|dictator]], permitted only to [[direct|direct]] assigned repairs. Age and loss were a [[disadvantage|disadvantage]], and [[disgrace|disgrace]] remained without repeated humiliation. The clinic would [[dispense|dispense]] its last purchased cloth. Emergency deliveries closed; ongoing treatment remained monthly obligations.","Each village kept [[documentary|documentary]] evidence. A [[duke|duke]]’s old grant could not [[easily|easily]] erase common-water clauses. Local people held the [[eastern|eastern]] branch. Shen helped [[edit|edit]] instructions so their [[effect|effect]] reached homes. Some no longer needed to [[emigrate|emigrate]]; others chose departure. Xu remained a bargaining [[enemy|enemy]] and accountable trader. Gu used his [[energy|energy]] to teach rulers, not demanding [[equal|equal]] skill from everybody, only knowing when to stop and call help.","The city reported Ji’s friend could sit outside, not walk long distances; continuing care was funded and wages reached home. Tax review separated Tao’s fraud and diversion liabilities, with returned property recorded. Punishment did not cancel debt. Luo planned seasonal follow-up. Shen paid his last personal clinic debt and retained paid apprentices. Identical long-term agreements belonged to every village, with next year’s review written. That review would use actual people and water, not let today’s good story decide the future."]});
